{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is oiia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. It is your best loyal companion. (singleplayer desktop pet game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. It is a great reason to start a party. (multiplayer (4 players) party game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. It is a way to find meaning in life. (game achievements and secrets to be discovered)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. It is your chance to become the meme.  (supports Steam Workshop to create your own talking desktop friend)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Click character to open menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Press the \u300cO\u300d\u3001\u300cI\u300d\u3001\u300cA\u300d\u3001\u300cU\u300d keys to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Drag character to move around the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Scroll mouse wheel while dragging to zoom the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Switch character to different screen: \u300cwin key\u300d + \u300cshift\u300d + left and right keys. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599510?t=1747326916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599510?t=1747326916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599510/525be0edb28587775fb673ae07c1eb217556d7e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747326916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599510/525be0edb28587775fb673ae07c1eb217556d7e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747326916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"note